{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["預言旱災"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華告訴耶利米有關旱災的事："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「猶大悲泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑衰敗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人坐在地上痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷哀鳴四起。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貴族派僕人去水池打水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"僕人去那裡發現沒有水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就帶著空瓶垂頭喪氣、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞愧地抱頭而歸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天不下雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"土地乾裂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"農夫沮喪地抱著頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為沒有草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的母鹿拋棄了剛生下來的小鹿；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為沒有草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野驢站在光禿的山頭上像豺狼一樣喘氣，雙目無神。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，雖然我們的罪控告我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們屢屢叛逆得罪你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你為了自己的名而拯救我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的盼望和患難時的救主啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為什麼在本地像個異鄉人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像個只住一夜的客旅呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為什麼像個受驚的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像個無力救人的勇士呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你一直都在我們中間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們屬於你的名下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要拋棄我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"關於這些百姓，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「他們喜歡遊蕩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不約束自己的腳步，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此耶和華不悅納他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在祂要追憶他們的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追討他們的罪。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華對我說：「你不要為這百姓求好處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["即使他們禁食，我也不會聽他們的呼求；他們獻上燔祭和素祭，我也不會悅納。我要用刀劍、饑荒和瘟疫滅絕他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我說：「主耶和華啊！眾先知不停地告訴他們不會有戰爭，也不會遭遇饑荒，說耶和華必在這地方賜給他們永久的平安。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華對我說：「那些先知奉我的名說假預言，我並沒有差派他們，沒有委任他們，也沒有對他們說話。他們對你們說的預言是假異象，是占卜，是他們心中的妄想。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我沒有差派他們，他們卻奉我的名預言這地方必沒有刀劍和饑荒。他們必死於刀劍和饑荒。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["聽他們說預言的人及其妻子兒女，必因饑荒和戰爭而曝屍耶路撒冷街頭，無人掩埋。因為我要使他們受到應得的報應。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「耶利米，你要對他們說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『讓我晝夜淚眼汪汪吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的處女同胞遭受重創，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傷勢危重。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我走到田間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼前是死於刀下的屍體；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我進入城裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"見饑荒肆虐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知和祭司也流亡異鄉","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":"。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你完全丟棄猶大了嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你厭惡錫安嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為什麼重重地打我們，以致無法醫治？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們期待平安，卻沒有祥和；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到醫治，卻飽受驚嚇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我們承認自己和我們祖先的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們誠然得罪了你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為了你的尊名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要厭惡我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓你榮耀的寶座蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顧念你與我們立的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要廢除它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在列國供奉的偶像中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能賜下雨水呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天能自降甘霖嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的上帝耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不是只有你能行這些事嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你行了這一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我們仰望你。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"「先知和祭司也流亡異鄉」或譯「連先知和祭司也渾渾噩噩，茫然無措」。","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":18}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}